#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:1
msgid "5.3 ROS2 Multi‑Machine Communication Configuration"
msgstr "5.3 ROS2多机通信配置"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:4
msgid ""
"The NX system provides a unified environment configuration file: "
"`/opt/runtime/env.bash`. This file is automatically sourced in `.bashrc`"
msgstr "NX系统中有统一配置的环境变量：`/opt/runtime/env.bash`, 这个变量在`.bashrc`中会默认导入"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:6
msgid "![图片](images/ROS2_Communication_Config.png)"
msgstr "![图片](images/ROS2_Communication_Config.png)"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:6
#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:23
msgid "图片"
msgstr "图片"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:8
msgid ""
"As shown above, `ROS_DOMAIN_ID=24`. The robot currently uses the ROS2 "
"Zenoh middleware to provide ROS2 topic services externally. Users are "
"required to install the corresponding environment on their own laptops."
msgstr "由上图可见，`ROS_DOMAIN_ID=24` ，目前机器狗使用 ros2 的 zenoh 中间件对外提供 ros2 topic 服务，需要用户在自己的笔记本安装相关环境。"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:10
msgid ""
"IP Configuration<br> Set the user laptop IP to: 192.168.168.xxx (xxx "
"cannot be 100, 168, or 255)"
msgstr "IP配置<br>配置用户笔记本 ip 为：`192.168.168.xxx`（xxx不能为100或者168或者255）"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:12
msgid "User Laptop Environment Configuration"
msgstr "用户笔记本环境配置"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:13
msgid "Ubuntu22.04"
msgstr "Ubuntu22.04"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:14
msgid "Ros2 humble"
msgstr "Ros2 humble"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:15
msgid "Zenoh rmw"
msgstr "Zenoh rmw"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:16
msgid "Install Zenoh"
msgstr "安装zenoh"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:20
msgid ""
"Modify the Configuration File<br> Open the following file with an "
"editor`/opt/ros/humble/share/rmw_zenoh_cpp/config/DEFAULT_RMW_ZENOH_ROUTER_CONFIG.json5`Locate"
" the `connect/endpoints` field and add the robot NX's IP address: "
"`\"tcp/192.168.168.100:7447\"`"
msgstr "修改配置文件<br>使用编辑器打开下面文件`/opt/ros/humble/share/rmw_zenoh_cpp/config/DEFAULT_RMW_ZENOH_ROUTER_CONFIG.json5`找到`connect/endpoints`字段，将机器狗NX的IP写入并保存: `"tcp/192.168.168.100:7447"`"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:23
msgid "![图片](images/Modify_Config_File.png)"
msgstr "![图片](images/Modify_Config_File.png)"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:25
msgid ""
"On the PC, open a new terminal 1 and set the middleware environment "
"variables and ROS2 Domain ID"
msgstr "在pc端新建终端1，设置中间件切换的环境变量以及 ROS2 的 Domain ID"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:32
msgid "Reset the ROS2 daemon"
msgstr "重置 ROS2 后台守护进程"

#: ../../source/5.3ROS2_Multi‑Machine_Communication_Configuration.md:37
msgid ""
"With the above environment variables set, you can use RViz for "
"visualization, record bag files, or launch your own ROS2 programs to "
"interact with the robot's drivers."
msgstr "在上述的环境变量生效的前提下即可使用 rviz 可视化，录包，或者启动自己的 ros2 程序与狗中的驱动交互。"

